+# Feature 001 — provenance and historical preservation
+
+## Import inventory
+
+Before migration the source repository had no tracked project-specific support files.
+The upstream root README, licenses, `doc/`, `tests/`, and build helpers were preserved.
+There were consequently no tracked moves or renames requiring `git mv`.
+
+These reusable files were copied from `C:\blender-git\` into
+`cycles_after_hours/tests/viewport-motion-blur/scripts/`:
+
+- `viewport-motion-test.py`
+- `viewport-motion-metrics.py`
+- `motion-steps-stress.py`
+- `motion-steps-metrics.py`
+- `accumulation-test.py`
+- `accumulation-check.py`
+
+Only the first five needed output-root changes; the checker is unchanged.
+`C:\blender-git\viewport-motion-tests\motion-test.blend` was copied byte-for-byte
+to `cycles_after_hours/tests/viewport-motion-blur/scenes/motion-test.blend`.
+Original files remain in place because historical reports and verification hashes
+refer to them. No generated screenshots, old logs or backup patches are imported
+into the source repository.
+
+## Frozen release
+
+`viewport-motion-blur-v0.1.1` remains at
+`a500f2f7eb7e50c40283f4da7e1a21a4761b0115`. Historical names identify an actual
+standalone release, not stale project branding, and must remain unchanged.
+
+Actual verified executable on this machine:
+
+```text
+C:\blender-git\build\_windows\_x64\_vc17\_Release\_v0.1.1\_fresh\bin\Release\blender.exe
+```
+
+The flat path `C:\blender-git\build_windows_x64_vc17_Release_v0.1.1_fresh`
+was named in the migration request but was not present during inspection. The
+existing nested build was verified as Blender 5.2.2 LTS, hash `a500f2f7eb7e`, branch
+`cycles-viewport-motion-blur`. No build was moved or renamed to reconcile the paths.
+
+Also preserved:
+
+- Development build: `C:\blender-git\build_windows_x64_vc17_Release`.
+- v0.1 fresh build: `C:\blender-git\build_windows_x64_vc17_Release_v0.1_fresh`.
+- v0.1.1 evidence: `C:\blender-git\release-v0.1.1-verification`.
+- Additional v0.1.1 results in `motion-steps-tests\release-v0.1.1` and
+  `accumulation-tests\release-v0.1.1` / `release-v0.1.1-camera-denoise`.
+- Entire original `viewport-motion-tests`, `motion-steps-tests`, `accumulation-tests`,
