+- Workspace-root scripts, logs, images/metrics and the original technical reports:
+  `viewport-motion-report.md`, `accumulation-report.md`, `motion-steps-report.md`.
+
+Those reports document earlier development states, including then-uncommitted work
+and superseded findings. They are historical evidence, not current Git status.
+The feature guide and implementation map consolidate their applicable findings;
+original reports remain available unchanged for the detailed investigation history.
+
+## Migration evidence
+
+New evidence lives separately at
+`C:\blender-git\cycles-after-hours-migration-verification`.
+It includes initial/final Git state, assertion comparison, the regression run and
+integrity manifests. The manifest covers historical workspace-root files and the
+complete evidence/backup directories above, plus each preserved build's executable
+and CMake cache. Build trees were not exhaustively hashed; no build command is run.
+Future results must use new directories and must not overwrite this or release evidence.
